{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JOB","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"约伯记","commonName":"约伯记","title":"约伯记","order":18,"numberOfChapters":42,"sha256":"874796c2a3eb73036d71ac9f1a85d305483400ee19fc61db9f76e87d836724b8","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JOB/1.json","lastChapterNumber":42,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JOB/42.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1067},"chapter":{"number":42,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"约伯回答耶和华说：","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我知道，你万事都能做；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的旨意不能拦阻。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谁用无知的言语使你的旨意隐藏呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我所说的是我不明白的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这些事太奇妙，是我不知道的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你听我，我要说话；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我问你，求你指示我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我从前风闻有你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"现在亲眼看见你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此我厌恶自己","poem":1},{"noteId":25},{"text":"，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在尘土和炉灰中懊悔。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["结尾"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["耶和华对约伯说话以后，就对提幔人以利法说：「我的怒气向你和你两个朋友发作，因为你们议论我不如我的仆人约伯说的是。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["现在你们要取七只公牛，七只公羊，到我仆人约伯那里去，为自己献上燔祭，我的仆人约伯就为你们祈祷。我因悦纳他，就不按你们的愚妄办你们。你们议论我，不如我的仆人约伯说的是。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["于是提幔人以利法、书亚人比勒达、拿玛人琐法照着耶和华所吩咐的去行；耶和华就悦纳约伯。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["约伯为他的朋友祈祷。耶和华就使约伯从苦境",{"noteId":26},"转回，并且耶和华赐给他的比他从前所有的加倍。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["约伯的弟兄、姊妹，和以先所认识的人都来见他，在他家里一同吃饭；又论到耶和华所降与他的一切灾祸，都为他悲伤安慰他。每人也送他一块银子和一个金环。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["这样，耶和华后来赐福给约伯比先前更多。他有一万四千羊，六千骆驼，一千对牛，一千母驴。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["他也有七个儿子，三个女儿。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["他给长女起名叫耶米玛，次女叫基洗亚，三女叫基连·哈朴。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["在那全地的妇女中找不着像约伯的女儿那样美貌。她们的父亲使她们在弟兄中得产业。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["此后，约伯又活了一百四十年，得见他的儿孙，直到四代。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["这样，约伯年纪老迈，日子满足而死。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":25,"caller":"-","text":"或译：我的言语","reference":{"chapter":42,"verse":6}},{"noteId":26,"caller":"-","text":"原文是掳掠","reference":{"chapter":42,"verse":10}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JOB/42.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/PSA/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JOB/41.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":17}